  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of a straight line passing through the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and normal to the curve <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "B0tWS",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "I7otO",
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "8CLRS",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "BvDpu",
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/dd4ab0c6-0425-473c-997e-088e2f7a504f.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.92708in;height:1.59375in\" /></p><p>Normal to the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> is<br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Since, it passes through the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> is a root<br />Hence, the required equation is&nbsp;<math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
